+## Local AI Office preview integration (2026-10-14)
+
+`apps/ai-office-preview` exposes page sizes, rasterization, paragraph state, save bytes and an allowlist of existing automation commands through WebAssembly. `Automation::open_bytes` and `image_bytes` support hosts without filesystem access. The sibling VS Code fork supplies paragraph editing, a compact toolbar and a CLI using the same bridge. Text/formatting, images, links, comments and undo/redo are covered by synthetic export/reopen tests in `../vscode/extensions/ai-office-common`. Upstream parity estimates are unchanged.
